  {
    "title": "GAPHTO Organise CPD program for Members",
    "slug": "continuous-professional-development-cpd",
    "description": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Ghana Association of Public Health Technical Officers which is an amalgamation of Disease Control Officers, Health Information Officers, Nutrition Officers, Health Records Assistants and Field Technicians working in the Ministry of Health, Ghana Health Service, Health Training Institutions and Christian Health Association of Ghana.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In its efforts to continuously build the capacity of its members, a three (3) days continuous professional development via virtual platforms. The webinar  was accredited by the Allied Health Professions Council of Ghana.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Topics and facilitators respectively</p>\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li><strong>The Role of Efficient Public Financial Management in Public Health Practice &#8211; </strong></li>\n<li><strong>Information Systems &amp; Technology in Public Health Emergencies  &#8211; <em><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Winfred Dotse-Gborgbortsi 9University of Southampton)</span></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Medico-Legal issues in Public Health Emergencies &#8211; <em>Yaw Brobbey-Mpiani (MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT &amp; LECTURER)</em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Updates from Regulatory Agencies &amp; Professional Association on Activities and Plans</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Full virtual session was adopted to avoid the likelihood of exposing participants to COVID-19 as the Country still grapple with the Pandemic.</p>\n<p>Below are key attendance statistics after the 3 day session.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"9068\" data-permalink=\"https://www.gaphto.org/2021/08/31/continuous-professional-development-cpd/screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4-57-33-pm/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?fit=1844%2C1380&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1844,1380\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2022-03-16 at 4.57.33 PM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-medium-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?fit=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1\" data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?fit=771%2C577&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-9068\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=771%2C577&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"577\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?w=1844&amp;ssl=1 1844w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=300%2C225&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=1024%2C766&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=768%2C575&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=1536%2C1150&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?resize=400%2C300&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/www.gaphto.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Screenshot-2022-03-16-at-4.57.33-PM.png?r